{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>My fruit is better</b> — and my produce [is better] than choice silver, or the word נבחר is as if it said נבחרת, like תפלצתך (Isaiah 28:19). The first is correct. The meaning: concerning what follows from wisdom — the rectification of the soul and the governance of the city."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:28.115012377Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}